{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20347","headline":"寄别者 · 张籍","name":"寄别者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒天正飞雪，行人心切切。\n同爲万里客，中路忽离别。\n别君汾水东，望君汾水西。\n积雪无平冈，空山无人蹊。\n羸马时倚辕，行行未遑食。\n下车劝僮仆，相顾莫叹息。\n讵知佳期隔，离念终无极。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}